      "title": "Publishers reporting",
      "description": "Distinct CEPA publishers seen. A publisher is whatever opened the connection — a CEE server, or an array publishing directly. On this estate 10.26.1.199 and 10.26.1.225 are CEE itself and 10.26.1.150-153 are OneFS nodes; the array behind CEE (10.26.1.224) never appears here, because CEE relays on its behalf. A drop means someone stopped talking; Publisher silence says who.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cee-prometheus"
