    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Deliveries against connection cadence",
      "description": "Whether event deliveries are driven by filesystem activity or by the connection clock.\n\nCEE redelivers an event it cannot retire, at the heartbeat interval, forever. Measured on this estate: one event from 2026-08-14 20:35:21, byte-identical on every delivery — same path, same timeStamp, same inode — six deliveries in 65 seconds alongside seven heartbeats. That is not throughput, and the consumer cannot tell the difference: an empty HTTP 200 is the whole acknowledgement CEE expects for an event batch (its binaries carry no CheckEventResponse literal at all), so a replay is indistinguishable from real traffic at the wire.\n\nSo the reading is the RELATIONSHIP, not the levels. Deliveries sitting exactly on the heartbeat line, both flat, is the replay signature. Deliveries varying independently of heartbeats is real traffic. Deliveries flat at zero while heartbeats run is the other CEE failure — registration refused, every observable green, nothing published.\n\nEstate-wide, not per publisher: the event counters carry no publisher label, because a batch is attributed to the exporter that parsed it rather than the array that sent it.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "cee-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cee_events_received_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "events parsed",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "cee-prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cee_cepa_heartbeats_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "heartbeats",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "cee-prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(cee_cepa_registrations_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "registrations",
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "cee-prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "events parsed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "registrations"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.lineStyle",
                "value": {
                  "fill": "dash",
                  "dash": [
                    10,
                    6
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "min",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
